      "observed": "Q8 value is Si2328DS (a P-channel MOSFET), but its library part is taylor_kicad:Q_NMOS_GSD and its MPN is DMN10H220L-7 (an N-channel MOSFET).",
      "expected": "A consistent N-channel MOSFET part, matching the Q_NMOS_GSD symbol and DMN10H220L-7 MPN.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "source": "netlist",
          "quote": "Q8 | Si2328DS | Package_TO_SOT_SMD:SOT-23-3 | taylor_kicad:Q_NMOS_GSD |  | MPN=DMN10H220L-7, Digikey=DMN10H220L-7DICT-ND, LCSC=C102615, Manufacturer=Diodes Incorporated"
        }
      ],
      "impact": "If the value field is used for assembly, a P-channel MOSFET would be installed in an N-channel position, likely preventing the circuit from switching correctly.",
      "confidence": 0.9
    },
    {
      "category": "wrong_value",
      "components": ["C54"],
      "pins": [],
      "nets": ["+5V", "0"],
      "observed": "C54 value is 0.1nF 50V, but its MPN is CC0603KRX7R9BB104 (0.1uF), and the SPICE deck models it as 0.1nF on +5V.",
      "expected": "0.1uF decoupling capacitor on +5V, consistent with the MPN and standard decoupling practice.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "source": "netlist",
          "quote": "C54 | 0.1nF 50V | Capacitor_SMD:C_0603_1608Metric | Device:C | Unpolarized capacitor | ... MPN=CC0603KRX7R9BB104"
        },
        {
          "source": "spice",
          "quote": "C54 +5V 0 0.1nF"
        }
      ],
      "impact": "The +5V rail would have 1000x less decoupling capacitance than intended, potentially causing noise or instability.",
      "confidence": 0.85
    },
    {
      "category": "footprint_mismatch",
      "components": ["J23", "J24"],
      "pins": [],
      "nets": [],
      "observed": "J23 and J24 are specified as Conn_01x01 (1-pin) symbols but use the parts:DF40C-100DS-0.4V51 footprint and MPN DF40HC(3.0)-100DS-0.4V(51), which are 100-pin CM4 connectors.",
      "expected": "100-pin connector symbols matching the 100-pin DF40 footprint and MPN, so all CM4 signals can connect.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "source": "netlist",
          "quote": "J23 | Conn_01x01 | parts:DF40C-100DS-0.4V51 | Connector_Generic:Conn_01x01 | ... MPN=DF40HC(3.0)-100DS-0.4V(51), Manufacturer=HRS(Hirose)"
        }
      ],
      "impact": "Only one pin of each 100-pin CM4 connector would be connected in the netlist, leaving most CM4 signals unconnected and the board nonfunctional.",
      "confidence": 0.8
    }
  ],
  "summary": "The design files contain multiple component identity/value mismatches, most notably Q8's P-channel value against an N-channel symbol/MPN, C54's 0.1nF value against a 0.1uF MPN, and J23/J24's 1-pin symbols against 100-pin CM4 connector footprints. These would cause incorrect assembly or connectivity."
}

